  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE:\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-72522.patch: stop the UTF-16 to UTF-16\n       converters mis-classifying a trailing low surrogate as a high\n       surrogate, which truncated input and lost a code unit, by masking\n       with 0xFC instead of 0xF8 in expat/lib/xmltok.c\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-76957.patch: protect the application-supplied\n       XML_Encoding convert and release callbacks from parser reentry by\n       routing them through expat's handler call-depth tracking in\n       expat/lib/xmlparse.c, closing a use-after-free\n     - CVE-2026-72522\n     - CVE-2026-76957",
